{
  "id": "oil_pipes___head_loss",
  "title": "Oil Pipes - Head Loss",
  "description": "Head or pressure loss due to friction in oil pipes - various viscosity and laminar flow. Calculates head loss in oil pipes with laminar flow based on viscosity, flow rate, and pipe diameter.",
  "type": "datatable",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Oil Pipes - Head Loss Calculator\n\nHead or pressure loss due to friction in oil pipes with laminar flow (Reynolds Number < 2300).\n\n**Variables:**\n- **h** = head loss (meter oil per metre oil pipe)\n- **f** = flow of oil (liter/s)\n- **d** = internal diameter of pipe (mm)\n- **Viscosity** = kinematic viscosity (cSt)\n\n**Formulas by Viscosity:**\n- 4 cSt: h = 1.7×10⁴ f / d⁴\n- 25 cSt: h = 11×10⁴ f / d⁴\n- 45 cSt: h = 20×10⁴ f / d⁴\n- 250 cSt: h = 110×10⁴ f / d⁴\n- 500 cSt: h = 220×10⁴ f / d⁴"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "viscosity",
          "label": "Viscosity (cSt)",
          "type": "select",
          "options": [
            {
              "value": 4,
              "label": "4 cSt"
            },
            {
              "value": 25,
              "label": "25 cSt"
            },
            {
              "value": 45,
              "label": "45 cSt"
            },
            {
              "value": 250,
              "label": "250 cSt"
            },
            {
              "value": 500,
              "label": "500 cSt"
            }
          ],
          "defaultValue": 25
        },
        {
          "id": "flow",
          "label": "Flow (l/s)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 1,
          "unit": "l/s"
        },
        {
          "id": "diameter",
          "label": "Pipe Diameter (mm)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 50,
          "unit": "mm"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "head_loss",
          "label": "Head Loss",
          "unit": "m/m",
          "format": "scientific",
          "formula": "((inputs.viscosity === 4 ? 1.7e4 : inputs.viscosity === 25 ? 11e4 : inputs.viscosity === 45 ? 20e4 : inputs.viscosity === 250 ? 110e4 : 220e4) * inputs.flow) / Math.pow(inputs.diameter, 4)"
        },
        {
          "id": "reynolds_number",
          "label": "Reynolds Number",
          "format": "decimal",
          "formula": "(1.49e5 * inputs.flow) / (inputs.diameter * inputs.viscosity)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "headers": [
        "Viscosity (cSt)",
        "Formula",
        "Coefficient (×10⁴)"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "4",
          "h = 1.7×10⁴ × f / d⁴",
          "1.7"
        ],
        [
          "25",
          "h = 11×10⁴ × f / d⁴",
          "11"
        ],
        [
          "45",
          "h = 20×10⁴ × f / d⁴",
          "20"
        ],
        [
          "250",
          "h = 110×10⁴ × f / d⁴",
          "110"
        ],
        [
          "500",
          "h = 220×10⁴ × f / d⁴",
          "220"
        ]
      ]
    }
  ]
}